body:
The avatar's nose was rendered as a downward-pointing triangle using `clip-path: polygon()`. Changed to heart shape for better Valentine's theme consistency.

## Changes

- **Avatar nose styling**: Replaced clip-path polygon with heart shape using rotated square + circular pseudo-elements
- Reduced size from 10px to 8px for better proportions with heart geometry
- Reused existing heart rendering technique from floating background hearts

```css
/* Before: downward triangle */
.avatar .nose {
  clip-path: polygon(50% 100%, 0 0, 100% 0);
  width: 10px; height: 10px;
}

/* After: heart shape */
.avatar .nose {
  transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(45deg);
  width: 8px; height: 8px;
  border-radius: 2px;
}
.avatar .nose::before, .avatar .nose::after {
  content: "";
  width: 8px; height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
}
```

